# Pruebas rápidas de la API TimeBank (se ejecutan desde VS Code con la extensión REST Client)
@api = http://localhost:5070/api

### Listar categorías
GET {{api}}/categories

### Crear usuario (recibe 2 horas de bienvenida)
POST {{api}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{ "firstName": "Ana", "lastName": "Pérez", "email": "ana@mail.com", "password": "123456" }

### Crear servicio
POST {{api}}/services
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": 1, "categoryId": 1, "title": "Clases de inglés", "description": "Nivel básico", "estimatedHours": 2 }

### Buscar servicios por categoría y texto
GET {{api}}/services?categoryId=1&search=ingles

### Solicitar un servicio
POST {{api}}/servicerequests
Content-Type: application/json

{ "serviceId": 1, "requesterId": 2, "requestedHours": 2, "message": "Quiero aprender" }

### Aceptar la solicitud
PUT {{api}}/servicerequests/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "Aceptada" }

### Completar la solicitud (transfiere las horas)
PUT {{api}}/servicerequests/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "Completada" }

# ==================== LOGIN (/api/auth) ====================

### Registrar cuenta
POST {{api}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "firstName": "Laura", "lastName": "Torres", "email": "laura.torres@mail.com", "password": "clave123", "phone": "0991112233" }

### Iniciar sesión (guarda el token en la variable "login")
# @name login
POST {{api}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "laura.torres@mail.com", "password": "clave123" }

### Ver mi perfil (necesita token)
GET {{api}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### Editar mi perfil
PUT {{api}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "firstName": "Laura", "lastName": "Torres Vega", "phone": "0998887766" }

### Ver mis sesiones
GET {{api}}/auth/sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### Cambiar contraseña
PUT {{api}}/auth/change-password
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "currentPassword": "clave123", "newPassword": "nueva456" }

### Cerrar otra sesión por su Id
DELETE {{api}}/auth/sessions/1
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### Cerrar sesión (logout): después el token ya no sirve
DELETE {{api}}/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
